            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JannG"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband thought he was eating scalloped potatoes. He's not adventerous with out of the norm veggies. Turnips were never a menu item for us. Since turnips were recently a part of my weekly CSA, I had to look for new recipe ideas. This was very tasty. I omitted the\nasafoetida powder and substituted cumin for turmeric since I don't have this spice.",
