              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa Welch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this the first time and made some errors. First oil. I don't like vegetable oil so I used olive. After it was too late, it occurred to me that I should have used coconut oil! So I then added some coconut oil. Then I used a little mustard instead of mustard seed. And finally I didn't steam with a little water but just used the heat from the oils. It was a little bitter so maybe it was the leaves. I will try this again with more care. I think it'll be a good turnip recipe.",
